# No environment variables are required for this project.
#
# Deployment is done from the browser using MetaMask — no RPC URL
# or private key is needed here.
#
# If you want to pre-set a deployed LettuceMarket address in the
# frontend (instead of entering it in the UI), create frontend/.env
# and add:
#
#   VITE_LETTUCE_MARKET_ADDRESS=0xYourDeployedLettuceMarketAddress
#
# Otherwise, deploy from the browser UI and the address is saved
# in localStorage automatically.
